  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AFG HAP 2010 OXFAM</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">AFG HAP 2010 OXFAM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">.OXFAM ska i Afghanistan genomf&#xF6;ra ett projekt inom vatten, sanitet och hygien i 100 samh&#xE4;llen. Dessa kommer att f&#xE5; tillg&#xE5;ng till rent dricksvatten,b&#xE4;ttre sanitetresurser, utbildning i hygien. Insatsen &#xE4;r ett av Sidas svar p&#xE5; FN HAP Hum assistance plan 2010.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OXFAM will implement an Emergency Water Sanitation and Hygiene Promotion project in 100 communities in Afghanistan. These will get access to sufficient quantities of potable water, access to sanitation facilities and improved awareness and practice of healthty hygiene behaviour through training sessions and kits.</narrative>
  </description>
